sequenceDiagram

    participant Client
    participant Authentication
    participant APIObject
    participant PermissionChecker
    participant JWT
    participant Database
    participant QueryResolver

    Client->>Authentication: Send API Request

    Authentication-->>PermissionChecker: Authenticated Request

    PermissionChecker->>APIObject: Read requestMetaData.permission

    alt Delegated Permissions Enabled

        PermissionChecker->>JWT: Read providedPermissions

        alt Permission Exists

            JWT-->>PermissionChecker: Permission Granted

        else Permission Missing

            PermissionChecker->>Database: Query Assigned Permissions

        end

    else No Delegated Permissions

        PermissionChecker->>Database: Query Assigned Permissions

    end

    Database-->>PermissionChecker: Permission Data

    PermissionChecker->>PermissionChecker: Build permission_results

    PermissionChecker-->>QueryResolver: Continue Processing

    QueryResolver-->>Client: API Response